   kvm_mmu_new_cr3+0x34/0x60 [kvm]
   nested_vmx_load_cr3+0xbd/0x1f0 [kvm_intel]
   nested_vmx_enter_non_root_mode+0xab8/0x1d60 [kvm_intel]
